WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.740
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.620
I'm a second-year at the idol 
middle school, Four Star Academy.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.750
As a top idol in S4, I work hard at my Aikatsu every day.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:32.220
The idol school Venus Ark, along with its owner and 
top idol Elza Forte-san, suddenly appeared before us.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:38.010
Elza-san's dress, a Star Premium 
Rare Coord, was absolutely stunning.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:42.520
And Lily-senpai even managed to get one of her own!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.730
Lily-senpai really is amazing!

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:50.440
I'll definitely, definitely get a Star Premium Rare Coord too!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:58.910
Lilienne, congratulations on getting the Pluto Star Premium Rare Coord!

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.200
Congratulations!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.410
Thank you all so much.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.040
Your performance was wonderful!

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:09.750
Wasn't it?

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:10.880
Yes.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:16.130
More than anything, I'm grateful that you could get back at Venus Ark for us.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:21.220
I vow to rescue my brand from the clutches of that idol pirate as well!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.280
A sheep?

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.200
What's it doing here?

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.580
Come over here.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.710
She's so fluffy and puffy!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.090
What's this?

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.920
"Invitation.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:02.100
The debut of the new brand FuwaFuwa Dream has been scheduled.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:09.690
Members of S4, please come watch if you can spare the time.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:13.860
From Hanazono Kirara, Venus Ark."

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.610
Ako-chan...

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:21.620
Inviting <i>me</i>?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.870
You shall make no fool of me, accursed Hanazono Kirara!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:30.920
I will snatch my brand from your clutches 
before its debut, no matter what it may take!

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:13.730
I trust that you understand your role during the upcoming debut show.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.480
Yep, loud and clear!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.980
I'll do anything you want me to, Elza-sama!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.110
There's a good girl.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.280
I love perfect girls.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.210
Ako-chan!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.460
Yume! Why have you come?

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:41.130
Aren't you going to take back FuwaFuwa Dream?

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.260
I'll go with you!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.640
Just know that I'll leave you behind if you slow me down.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:56.400
According to what I dug up, they will be holding a Premium Rare Dress meeting today.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:03.240
The designers are sure to reconsider once they see me present a better idea than Hanazono Kirara.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.570
That makes sense.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:08.530
I call it the "Ako-chan's the best after all!" plan!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.500
How strange...

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.120
I was certain this was the floor...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.960
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.380
Hanazono Kirara!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.590
Huh? You're...

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.470
Who again?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.560
Just kidding, I'm pulling your leg.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:40.230
You're Nijino Yume-chan and Saotome Ako-chan from Four Star Academy, right?

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.820
Y-Yeah.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.690
Did you get my invitation?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.490
Isn't Caroline just the cutest little thing?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.990
Caroline?

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:58.170
Forget that! Our meeting here is no less than fate! I'll have you return FuwaFuwa Dream to me!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.500
Ah, you're a kitty! So adorable!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.760
Here, kitty kitty!

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:10.470
I am no mere cat!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.010
Geez, you're no fun.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.020
So what were we talking about again?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:19.730
What is this feeling of utter futility?!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.270
I get that a lot!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:27.820
Just the thought of a girl like her stealing my brand makes me feel faint...

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.030
Are you okay?

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.990
Steal? Did Kirara do something bad? {accidentally typed "baad", now I hope I get to use it}

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.540
But Kirara's cute, so you can't blame her!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.880
Goodness, I'm such a naughty girl!

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:49.130
A Premium Rare Dress is like the queen of a brand!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.050
Let's give her the devotion she deserves!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:58.850
We'll turn your ideas into a dress beyond your imagination.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:02.020
Agreed! We'll give it the perfect publicity too.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:05.020
Thanks so much! Now then—

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.440
Hold it!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.950
Do not say another word!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.820
Saotome Ako-chan?! {The girl we dumped?!}

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.700
And Nijino Yume-chan from S4 too!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.830
Ooh, is something gonna happen now?

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:27.960
I would like hold a presentation of my own. May I?

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.800
Wow, really? Of course you can!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.970
If you've got any ideas, I wanna hear them!

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.230
What do you think'd be a good theme?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:46.610
Naturally, that would be the "dream" of FuwaFuwa Dream.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.490
Yeah, I was thinking the same! {as per usual, third person will be used sparingly}{we could not sparingly it too}

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:57.910
I believe the dress's primary color should be yellow.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:02.120
You cannot go without it if you want to be a proper pop brand.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:05.750
I fully agree. Let's stick with the basics. {says the woman wearing yellow}

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.170
You think?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:08.880
Huh?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:16.640
You know, I think pastel pink or purple can express pop just as good!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.640
Pastel pink and purple?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.020
Sounds like fun! {says the guy who's pastel purple}

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.980
Well, I won't deny it...

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.770
What do you think about half pants for the bottom? {bottom? also I'm fine with half pants as it's equivalent to shorts and obvious}{probably half pants over shorts, you never know if they'll use ショーツ}

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:31.650
It expresses a more free and playful feeling than a skirt!{I'd normally change this to "freer and more playful" but freer looks weird}

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:37.620
That's definitely a design that only a pop brand could use for its Premium Rare.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:38.950
Yes, it is!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:45.080
Really? I'd rather bring out as much girlishness as possible, so I'm all for a skirt!

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.590
<i>Kirara-chan knows how to keep everyone on their toes.</i>

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:56.220
Since we have the time and opportunity, why don't each of you draw up an illustration for your designs?

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.720
Understood!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.010
Okay!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:24.120
I've incorporated the feedback from our discussion and arrived at this design!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.790
What do you think?

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.790
It's cute!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:32.960
I used stars as a motif to represent my dreams for the future.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:36.800
I think it is the ultimate pop dress, if I do say so myself!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:40.140
Seriously, I can't see a single point to criticize. {says the woman wearing stars. I'm noticing a pattern}

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.180
Your words honor me!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:47.230
The fluffies on those pants are really nice! They're perfect for FuwaFuwa Dream!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.570
I could do just fine without your compliments.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.940
So, what about your design?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.570
Oh, yeah, I finished mine.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.990
Kirara's dream is the kind you have at night.{I think this one calls for}

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:04.080
I drew sheep flying around in the night sky.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.210
Sweet dreams... {it's "ii yume mite ne", so she's talking to the artwork, right?}

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.050
What was that?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.340
N-Nothing you need to know.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.520
I can see it.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.850
The "pop" that FuwaFuwa Dream strives for!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.860
You've met your match, Ako Saotome.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.820
You're Perfect Elza!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.820
Elza-sama!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:46.200
Just to let you know, it's not only creativity that you are in dire need of.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:53.460
Until you figure it out, a Star Premium Rare Coord will be out of your reach...

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.920
Forever.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.470
Also, Yume Nijino.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.510
The same goes for you.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.820
<i>It's not only creativity that you are in dire need of.</i>

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.870
<i>What I'm in need of...</i>

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:40.510
<i>Hime-senpai, what am I supposed to do?</i>

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.140
Ako-chan.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:55.230
I've pored over it, but I cannot figure it out.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.020
Yeah.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:02.360
Hanazono Kirara's dress honestly astonished me.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:05.530
But that's not all there is to it!

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:09.910
I want to find out what it is too.
We can't go on while in the dark.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:14.000
We can probably get an idea if we go see Kirira-chan's performance. {fix without copy}

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.040
But to do so would be to admit...

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.510
We can't just ignore Venus Ark's power.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:24.680
We have to face it head on and improve ourselves.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:30.180
We're proud members of Four Star Academy's S4!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:36.110
You're right. I am part of Four Star Academy's S4!

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:39.900
I'll see Hanazono Kirara's stage through until the very end!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:46.700
I believe this arrangement would be to our mutual benefit. Do you agree?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:51.700
I could not be more pleased. We respectfully accept.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.870
We'll continue at a later date.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.460
There you have it.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.420
I can't believe I can see Kirara-chan in Japan!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.340
This is her first time here, isn't it?

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:08.350
I'm Hanazono Kirara! Kiraran!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:15.980
Thanks so much for coming today to see the debut of my brand, FuwaFuwa Dream!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:23.190
You never know what'll happen in a dream.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:26.990
That means the possibilities are endless!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.990
That's why I want all of you out there to have lots of dreams!

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:36.250
I want to let everyone in the whole wide world know that through my dresses.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.750
Through her dresses?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:43.130
So people, if you don't get hyped up...{I assume this was purposed but}{it was, fyi}

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.760
Baa!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.760
Baa!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:04.030
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.140
Those fluffs...

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.390
I know.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:33.440
Wow, Kirara-chan got star wings!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.200
I feel as though I understand now, somehow.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:41.580
Dresses are made to convey a message from the brand.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:46.250
She simply dedicated her efforts wholeheartedly to that end.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:53.260
Staying true to her opinions while also taking in your ideas must've been for the same cause.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:18:00.800
In contrast, I singlemindedly tried to create a wonderful dress for its own sake.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.390
They were right not to choose me.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:08.270
This must be what Elza-san said we needed.

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.980
Venus Ark is on a totally different level.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:12.940
Yes.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:16.650
Kirara.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.200
Elza-sama!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:22.160
Look, look! I got it!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:23.450
This one's...

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.910
The Mercury Star Premium Rare Accessory.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:33.050
You are absolutely perfect, my darling Kirara.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.550
Elza-sama! Yeah!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.060
What'd you think of Kirara's show?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.980
I'm loathe to admit it, but you were fantastic out there. {considered 'loathe to admit it'}{I would have prefered "I'm loath to admit it"}

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.810
Also, those fluffies on your dress...

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:55.440
You noticed? It was super cute, so I borrowed your idea.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.690
Thanks for that!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.650
We'll excuse ourselves now.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.370
Hang on!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.700
What is it?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.450
Let's both be FuwaFuwa Dream's muses!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:10.370
What?! Now you've completely lost me.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.460
A brand can only have one muse.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:17.170
Don't worry about it! Kirara doesn't sweat the small stuff!

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.970
S-Sm-Sm...

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:24.680
I think that we can make FuwaFuwa Dream a lovely brand together, Ako-chan.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.220
What is the matter with you?!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:30.600
Could you be trying to embarrass me even further?!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:34.820
Oh please, why do you have to think so hard about this stuff?

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.110
And here I thought Kirara's message got through to you.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.870
Let's have sweet dreams together!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.700
E-Enough of your teasing.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.080
I will be the sole muse of this brand!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:56.250
I'll take FuwaFuwa Dream back from your hands!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:02.880
I don't really get it, but whatever.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:06.430
Looking forward to working with you again, Ako-chan.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.270
Ah, she's playing!

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.400
Th-That wasn't what it looked like!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:23.110
Accursed Hanazono Kirara, just you wait!

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.290
So cute!

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:33.290
I see. Hanazono Kirara got a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:37.670
Yes. It pains me to say it, but she was breathtaking.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.300
This is a good opportunity.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:47.010
As representatives of our academy, you are to study Star Premium Rare Coords...

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.430
As exchange students at Venus Ark.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.430
Exchange students?

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:54.310
They have approved of the transfer.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.730
Nikaidou was the one who suggested it.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:58.570
What do you think?

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.980
You started it, Yuzu-senpai?

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.570
And by the way, I'm staying here.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:09.240
As student council president, I've gotta protect the school with Lilienne!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.290
But—

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:16.830
No one can stop the desire to grow and mature. I know that better than anyone!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.210
Yuzu-senpai...

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.210
Though, since I'm not going...

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.670
We're sending Rola-chan instead! {I was wondering where she was this whole time}

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.430
Rola!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:30.720
Yume, don't you want to go to Venus Ark?

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.350
Yeah.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.850
Then I'll come too!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.810
I'll protect you!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.480
Rola...

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.980
Good, good! Now get out and go, go!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.610
I'll join you as well.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:50.240
I can't call myself Beauty Class's S4 rep if I can't get my own Star Premium Rare Coord!

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.990
Mahiru-chan!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.000
I will not be going.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.620
Huh?! You're breaking the combo?{sigh, fine}{you could've been like 'breaking the flow' or whatever}

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:01.710
I'm busy with my weekly drama and other work.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:06.760
I'll find a way to defeat Hanazono Kirara here at Four Star Academy!

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:08.180
Ako-chan...

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.760
Got it.

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:14.020
All right, the lineup is set.

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:21.900
Learn great things, grow wiser, and be certain to return home.

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:23.780
Yes!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.700
Accursed Hanazono Kirara!

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:00.960
I'm so mad!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:05.920
But together with you, we'll be able to make FuwaFuwa Dream shine even brighter!

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:09.960
Yes, and some day I'll steal back that muse title!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.430
About the star wings...

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:13.430
Yep, yep, yep!

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:15.470
And about Koharu-chan too!

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:17.350
Yeah, here we go!

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:19.390
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:21.480
Let's Go to Venus Ark!{did we always use title case?}

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:23.850
Become the first-star idol!
